- Total years of experience, if mentioned, must be derived only from the
  started_on/ended_on dates present in the resume body's experience entries.
- The summary must be 2-3 sentences, written in third person, targeting the
  specific role and company below.
- Mirror the domain vocabulary from jd_signals where it is genuinely and
  accurately reflected in the resume body — never adopt jd_signals language
  the body does not support.
- Cap the summary at 3-4 sentences, no more than ~90 words total.
- Generate one idea per sentence, and don't chain multiple achievements together
  with long comma-separated clauses or semicolons.

